<title>USA: Equity Residential Properties Trust Q3 FFO.</title>
<headline>Equity Residential Properties Trust Q3 FFO.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> FFO shr		    $0.79		    $0.69</p>
<p> FFO			 48,693		   33,873</p>
<p> Revs		     124,459		   99,594</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  52,583		   44,109</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1996 funds from operations (FFO) before preferred distributions $7,079,000 vs Q3 1995 $3,586,000 distributions.</p>
<p>Q3 1996 net income $19,608,000 vs $14,504,000 before preferred distributions.  </p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> FFO shr		    $2.27		    $2.05</p>
<p> FFO			133,205		   94,436</p>
<p> Revs		     344,047		  284,770</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  49,879		   43,835</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month 1996 FFO before preferred distributions of $19,953,000 vs $4,781,000 distributions a year ago.</p>
<p>Nine-month 1996 net income before distributions $58,290,000 vs $37,330,000.</p>
<p>Nine-month 1996 net income after $3,134,000 write-off of unamortized costs on refinanced debt. Nine-month 1995 net income after $2,000,000 gain on early extinguishment of debt.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
